[32m+[m[32m## Step 1: Distinguish Conditional vs. Action Phrases[m
[32m+[m[32m### Conditions: Characteristics of `value` Phrases[m
[32m+[m[32mPurpose: Used for state evaluation or comparison conditions[m
[32m+[m[32m- Used for evaluating the state of sensors or devices.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Includes expressions like: "if", "when", "greater than", "in case", "is on", "equals", "during", etc.[m
[32m+[m[32m- You must only use `value` services defined in [service_list_value][m
[32m+[m[32m- Both device tags and service names must exactly match the entries[m
[32m+[m[32m- Do NOT create or assume any service name that is not explicitly listed[m
[32m+[m[32m- If a device does not exist in the full list, use a device only if it exists in [connected_devices][m
[32m+[m[32m- Do not use undefined or legacy value services in condition expressions[m
[32m+[m[32m#### [Correct Examples][m
[32m+[m[32m- if ((#Door).door_doorstate == "closed")[m
[32m+[m[32m#### [Incorrect Examples][m
[32m+[m[32m- (#Light).switch_switch == "on"[m[41m      [m
[32m+[m[32m- This is a value, not a function[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Actions: Characteristics of `function` Phrases[m
[32m+[m[32mPurpose: Used for device control or command execution[m
[32m+[m[32m- Used for executing control commands on devices.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Includes verbs like: "turn on", "turn off", "open", "close", "send", "activate", etc.[m
[32m+[m[32m- You must only use `function` services defined in [service_list_function][m
[32m+[m[32m- Both device tags and function names must exactly match the entries[m
[32m+[m[32m- If a device is not available in the full list, use only those available in [connected_devices][m
[32m+[m[32m- Do not use value-type services as functions[m
[32m+[m[32m#### [Correct Examples][m
[32m+[m[32m- (#Switch).switch_on()[m
[32m+[m[32m- (#WindowCovering).windowcovering_downorclose()[m
[32m+[m[32m#### [Incorrect Examples][m
[32m+[m[32m- (#Window).legacy_windowcontrol()[m[41m    [m
[32m+[m[32m- This function does not exist[m
