[32m+[m[32m## Step 2: Prepare extracted `value`/`function` for JOI Lang processing[m
[32m+[m[32m### Split compound natural language commands into:[m
[32m+[m[32m- `value` expressions (conditions) → Convert into sensor evaluation expression:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m  `if ((#Sensor).attribute >= value)`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `function` expressions (actions) → Convert into device command expression:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m  `(#Tag).function_on()`[m
[32m+[m[32m#### [Example][m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32mCommand: “If it’s raining and the window is open, close the window.”[m
[32m+[m[32m- `value`:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - “It’s raining”[m
[32m+[m[32m  - “The window is open”[m
[32m+[m[32m- `function`:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - “Close the window”[m
