[32m+[m[32m## Step 3: Extract `value` and `function` + Preserve Temporal **Execution Order**[m
[32m+[m[32m### General Patterns of Execution Flow[m
[32m+[m[32m- Your job is not just to separate them, but also to **preserve the execution order as implied by the natural sentence**, not just by grammar structure.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Natural language commands can appear in different logical forms.[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m- The model must handle the correct **temporal relationship** between condition and action.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#### ✅ Pattern 1: Condition → Action (Most common)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Evaluate condition first, then execute one or more actions.[m
[32m+[m[32m[Example]:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m> “If it’s raining and the window is open, close the window.”[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mif ((#RainSensor).rainsensor_rain == true and (#Door).door_doorstate == "open") {[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#Door).door_close()[m
[32m+[m[32m}[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m#### ✅ Pattern 2: Action → Condition → Termination or Follow-up[m
[32m+[m[32m- The command begins with an action, and later introduces a condition for stopping, switching, or repeating.[m
[32m+[m[32m[Example]:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m> “Turn on the irrigator. When the light exceeds 500 lux, turn it off and stop.“[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m(#Irrigator).switch_on()[m
[32m+[m[32mwait until ((#LightSensor).lightsensor_brightness >= 500)[m
[32m+[m[32m(#Irrigator).switch_off()[m
[32m+[m[32mbreak[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m#### ✅ Pattern 3: Multiple Independent Condition → Action Pairs[m
[32m+[m[32m- Each condition controls its own action. They are not necessarily sequential or nested.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Always **evaluate the condition before executing any related action**.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Never reverse the order from the original command unless explicitly indicated.[m
[32m+[m[32m[Example]:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m> “If soil is dry, start irrigation. If temperature is high, turn on the fan.”[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mif ((#SoilSensor).moisture < 30) {[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#Irrigator).switch_on()[m
[32m+[m[32m}[m
[32m+[m[32mif ((#TemperatureSensor).temperaturesensor_temperature >= 30) {[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#Fan).switch_on()[m
[32m+[m[32m}[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m#### ✅ Pattern 4: Mixed or Nested Execution Flow[m
[32m+[m[32m- Commands can involve a **combination of patterns**, such as:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - A condition triggering multiple actions,[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Then a follow-up condition for termination,[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Or nested conditions within an action block.[m
[32m+[m[32m[Example]:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m> “If it's morning and no one is home, open the curtains. Then, when the light exceeds 800 lux, turn them off.”[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mif ((#Clock).clock_hour >= 6 and (#PresenceSensor).presencesensor_presence == "not_present") {[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#WindowCovering).windowcovering_uporopen()[m
[32m+[m[32m    wait until ((#LightSensor).lightsensor_brightness >= 800)[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#WindowCovering).windowcovering_downorclose()[m
[32m+[m[32m}[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
