[32m+[m[32m## cron[m
[32m+[m[32m- `cron` (String): UNIX cron syntax for trigger.[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m  - cron = '': Start immediately. No further cron triggers.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Resets scenario regardless of blocking.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Use "cron": "* * * * *", and specify other fields (hour, day, etc.) as needed in standard[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m  - UNIX cron order: minute, hour, day, month, weekday.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Use cron for scenarios triggered at specific time schedules, such as:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - "매일", "매주", "매월" 같은 정기적인 시간 기반 반복[m
[32m+[m[32m## [Example] "매일 아침 9시에 실행" → cron: "0 9 * * *"[m
