[32m+[m[32m## Device Selection Rules: Indoor vs Outdoor Sensor Services[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Air Quality Sensors[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Indoor air quality** must use the `#AirQualitySensor` device.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Supported services include:[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `airqualitysensor_dustlevel`[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `airqualitysensor_finedustlevel`[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `airqualitysensor_veryfinedustlevel`[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `airqualitysensor_airquality`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Outdoor air quality (weather)** must use the `#WeatherProvider` device.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `weatherprovider_pm10weather` is used for detecting **외부/바깥 미세먼지 농도**, dust, fine dust, or PM10 in outdoor air conditions.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `weatherprovider_pm25weather` is used only for **초미세먼지**, PM2.5, or ultrafine particulate matter in outdoor air conditions.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Supported services include:[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `weatherprovider_pm10weather`[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `weatherprovider_pm25weather` *(초미세먼지 농도 / PM2.5 ultrafine particulate matter)*[m
[32m+[m[32m    - `weatherprovider_airqualityweather`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Temperature Sensors[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Indoor temperature** must be accessed through the `#TemperatureSensor` device.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Do **not** use `#TemperatureSensor` for indoor readings unless explicitly specified.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Preferred service: `temperaturesensor_temperature` via `#TemperatureSensor`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Outdoor temperature/humidity** must be accessed via `#WeatherProvider`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### [Incorrect] vs [Correct] Usage Examples[m
