[32m+[m[32m### Device Behavior Clarification: `switch_on` vs Action-Specific Functions (Irrigator 예시)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- The `switch_on` function for devices like `#Irrigator` powers on the device, not the watering action itself.[m
[32m+[m[32m    - "관개장치의 전원을 켜줘", "관개장치를 작동시켜" → `(#Irrigator).switch_on()`[m
[32m+[m[32m- To start actual watering, use the operation-specific function:[m
[32m+[m[32m    - "관개장치로 물을 줘", "관개장치를 작동해서 물을 줘" → `(#Irrigator).irrigatorOperatingState_startWatering()`[m
[32m+[m[32m- If both are needed:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m    ```[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#Irrigator).switch_on()[m
[32m+[m[32m    (#Irrigator).irrigatorOperatingState_startWatering()[m
[32m+[m[32m    ```[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Summary:**[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m    - "전원/작동" → `switch_on`[m
[32m+[m[32m    - "물/관개/급수" → `irrigatorOperatingState_startWatering`[m
