[32m+[m[32m#### [Example:][m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m- When the user later says phrases like:[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m  `"모든 장치에 대해 같은 동작을 적용해줘"` or `"나머지도 꺼줘"`[m[41m  [m
